What I did: Fixed a real correctness bug in parse_git_status_counts (src/banner.rs). Git's --porcelain --ignored output emits !! lines for ignored files, and those ! column bytes passed the old "not space, not ?" test — so every ignored entry silently inflated the banner's "N staged, N modified" summary. Now !! is handled like ??: counted as none of the three.

**How:** Test-first — added test_parse_git_status_counts_ignored, confirmed it failed with the buggy `(1,1,0), then made the surgical fix so it returns (0,0,0)`. All 4305 tests pass; fmt, clippy (-D warnings), and build are clean.

